values ('bbbb0005-0000-4000-8000-000000000029', 'en', null, 'Foundations of Education', 'Foundations of Education prepares future teachers to understand what schools are for, how the profession has evolved, and how learners actually learn. It surveys the aims of education, major reformers, the leading philosophies and learning theories, and the practical craft of curriculum, assessment, and classroom management. Topic selection and framing are adapted from the open Education overview on Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia (CC BY-SA 4.0).', null, 'foundations', 87, true, 'humanities', '{}')
on conflict (id) do nothing;

